          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The following SQL statement deletes all data from a table name &quot;Products&quot;. Which query fully logs the remove of each record?</p><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">A. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TRUNCATE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products <span class=\"hljs-operator\">*</span>;\nB. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DELETE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products;\nC. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DELETE</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">*</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products;\nD. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TRUNCATE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TABLE</span> Products;</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Câu lệnh SQL sau xoá toàn bộ dữ liệu từ bảng &quot;Products&quot;. Câu truy vấn nào ghi log đầy đủ việc xoá từng bản ghi?</p><pre><code class=\"language-sql\">A. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TRUNCATE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products <span class=\"hljs-operator\">*</span>;\nB. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DELETE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products;\nC. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DELETE</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">*</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> Products;\nD. <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TRUNCATE</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">TABLE</span> Products;</code></pre></div>",
